// REJECTS: Unexpected token 'connection'. Valid alternatives: ['mappings', 'connections', 'connectionStores']
//
// `connection:` (singular) is legal ONLY inside a SingleConnectionRuntime. A plain Runtime
// takes `connections:` (store-keyed) or `connectionStores:` (connection-keyed) and neither
// collapses to the singular form even when there is exactly one connection.
//
// Two element types, four keywords, three of which differ by one character. A rewrite with
// one runtime-body routine accepts all four everywhere; the inverse case is pinned in
// neg-connection-singleruntime-plural-connections.pure. runtime-forms.pure writes both
// elements legally and cannot see either direction.
###Runtime
Runtime fixture::neg::SingularConnection
{
   connection: fixture::neg::Conn;
   mappings:
   [
      fixture::neg::PersonMapping
   ];
}
